  "description": "*“As expected of the Number One Sword Under Heaven. I cannot let you live.”*\n\nBaek Yang-Hwi finds himself on the verge of death after being ambushed. He still hadn’t managed to elevate his family into one of the great clans… It definitely happened that way. \n\n *“Did I really return to when I was eight years old?”* \n\nHis family is third-rate, but his talent is the greatest in all of history. A life that has begun anew. This time, I will definitely turn my family into the greatest clan under heaven! \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
